    "title": "Algorithm to Visualize Volcanic Lava Flows",
    "description": "Visualizes active volcanic lava flows from Sentinel-2 imagery using SWIR Band 12 thermal-emission thresholds blended into a base map that preserves soil, built-up areas, vegetation, and water bodies. Supports a continuous lava intensity heatmap, binary lava detection in red or yellow, and a context-preserving style that retains underlying land-cover information for situational awareness. Includes optional cloud avoidance logic to reduce false detections. Adapted from a SentinelHub Custom Script by Markuse, P, Coppola, D., Wright, R..",
